        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-405, 3 Inch Ridged Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere is something very homey about this cabinet pull; yet it remains sophisticated. The Ridged Cabinet Pull is beautiful because it is fancy without being overly so. The ridged style is a classic for a good reason--it is chic and expensive-looking way to add warmth and beauty to any space. The 3\" Ridged Cabinet Door Handle is available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/melon-cabinet-door-knob-rk-international-ck-205\"><b>Matching CK-205 Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-405 3 Fancy Ridged Cabinet Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
